# Batch 06: exact algebra (bigint / matrices / rings / GF / elliptic curves). Any diff = UB.
bigint 2^200 + 1
bigint 100! / 98!
bigint gcd(2^120 - 1, 2^90 - 1)
bigint factor 2^64 + 1
bigint isprime(2^127 - 1)
bigint -7 div 2
bigint -7 % 2
snf [[2, 4, 4], [-6, 6, 12], [10, -4, -16]]
snf [[1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6], [7, 8, 9]]
hnf [[0, 3, 6], [0, 2, 4], [1, 1, 1]]
inverse 3 mod 256
inverse 7 mod 2^64
order 3 mod 2^64
phi 100
carmichael 561
factorint 600851475143
ring Z/12 units
ring Z/30 idempotents
congruence 3x = 4 mod 7
congruence 6x = 4 mod 10
crt x = 2 mod 3, x = 3 mod 5
congruence x^2 + x + 1 = 0 mod 7
ecpoints y^2 = x^3 + 2x + 3 mod 97
ecadd y^2 = x^3 + 2x + 3 mod 97 (3, 6) + (80, 10)
ecmul y^2 = x^3 + 2x + 3 mod 97 5 (3, 6)
ec secp256k1
ecmul secp256k1 2 G
